GasTest
├── When benchmarking bid updates
│   └── It should record first bids ties top ups and cancellation.
├── When benchmarking a populated bid book
│   └── It should record insertion and draw start with one hundred twenty eight prices.
├── When benchmarking donation paths
│   └── It should record safe donations and permissionless syncing.
├── When benchmarking a draw without a bonus
│   └── It should record request callback finalization claim and proceeds withdrawal.
├── When benchmarking a draw with a bonus
│   └── It should record finalization and an independent bonus claim.
├── When benchmarking late arrivals
│   └── It should record finalization with both inventory moves.
└── When benchmarking terminal exit
    └── It should record shutdown refunds and unsold recovery.
